#: ../../tools/pharmvar_tools.rst:32 c1058d2498414cad887ca10819603d3e
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get all allele definitions for a pharmacogene from "
"PharmVar (Pharmacogene Variation Consortium). Returns star allele names "
"(e.g., CYP2D6\\*1, \\*4, \\*17), functional status, activity scores, "
"variant details (HGVS notation, rsIDs, genomic positions), and evidence "
"levels. PharmVar is the authoritative source for pharmacogenomic star "
"allele nomenclature used in CPIC guidelines."
msgstr ""

